%% Semantic write and read
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as OrchestratorOrTool
  participant K as KnowledgeService
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant E as Embedder
  O->>K: write Memory.md
  K->>K: authorize namespace from JWT
  K->>DB: insert revision
  K->>E: enqueue embed
  O->>K: retrieve query
  K->>DB: ACL filter then rank
  DB-->>K: hits
  K-->>O: ranked memories
